{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u300aWonderland\u300b\u2014 Forge Your Own Fantasy Tactics Legend!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a world of swords and sorcery, and build your unique adventurer\u2019s guild!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Strategy-First Tactical Gameplay</strong> <br><strong>Wisdom decides life or death; terrain turns the tide!</strong> <br>\u25b8 Assemble 4-hero squads tailored to missions with class and terrain tactics. <br>\u25b8 <strong>Dynamic Success Rate</strong>: Squad level/gear/stats affect outcomes. High-risk S-rank missions\u2014<i>timed and unique</i>! <br>\u25b8 <strong>Guild Co-op</strong>: Deploy members to solve puzzles, charge foes, or heal allies in brain-teasing yet thrilling turn-based battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928980/extras/227b4100dd3fda3e29ec7ff63d6b3cf5.poster.avif?t=1774165707\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928980/extras/227b4100dd3fda3e29ec7ff63d6b3cf5.webm?t=1774165707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928980/extras/227b4100dd3fda3e29ec7ff63d6b3cf5.mp4?t=1774165707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Revolutionary Freeform Build System</strong> <br><strong>Your Weapon, Your Destiny!</strong> <br> \u2705 <strong>Affix Crafting</strong>: Enchant gear, lock rare attributes, and combine them to create <i>game-breaking combat styles</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928980/extras/4ecf8fd3ae8673b3315d5999e6bdc2ca.poster.avif?t=1774165707\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928980/extras/4ecf8fd3ae8673b3315d5999e6bdc2ca.webm?t=1774165707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928980/extras/4ecf8fd3ae8673b3315d5999e6bdc2ca.mp4?t=1774165707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;No Class Restrictions&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Dynamic Skill System</strong>: Skills evolve with weapon type and mastery\u2014switch freely between Warrior, Assassin, or Mage paths. <br>\u2705 <strong>Deep Talent Tree</strong>: Unlock hundreds of talents through progression and customize your growth path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;From rookie to legend\u2014every step is yours to define.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928980/extras/ca868ed893ec3e23aa4e24db360a5963.poster.avif?t=1774165707\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928980/extras/ca868ed893ec3e23aa4e24db360a5963.webm?t=1774165707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928980/extras/ca868ed893ec3e23aa4e24db360a5963.mp4?t=1774165707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Living Guild Ecosystem</strong> <br><strong>From a rundown tavern to continental dominance\u2014your leadership rules all!</strong> <br>\u2705 <strong>Recruitment</strong>: Monthly refresh of unique characters\u2014recruit and train rising stars with gold. <br>\u2705 <strong>Resource Management</strong>: Triple-currency economy (Gold/EXP/Prestige)\u2014strategically allocate gear and potions. <br>\u2705 <strong>Guild Progression</strong>: Unlock shops, forges, and training grounds. Rise in prestige to access elite quests!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Fire underperformers. Train superstars. Forge your golden team!&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928980/extras/d18957a5c534a12ba9b8fad2844eafd4.poster.avif?t=1774165707\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928980/extras/d18957a5c534a12ba9b8fad2844eafd4.webm?t=1774165707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928980/extras/d18957a5c534a12ba9b8fad2844eafd4.mp4?t=1774165707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Immersive Fantasy World</strong><br>Step into the continent of Elphar and pursue the legendary Nine Sanctuaries!<br>\u25b8 Boost vitality in mechanical ruins, unlock divine gear through lost gates\u2014each sanctuary holds power to reshape destiny.<br>\u25b8 Explore perilous ruins, solve ancient puzzles, and conquer guardians to claim rare gear and epic materials!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928980/extras/d45b5260b7c27aaf2509744fb2cbf2de.poster.avif?t=1774165707\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928980/extras/d45b5260b7c27aaf2509744fb2cbf2de.webm?t=1774165707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928980/extras/d45b5260b7c27aaf2509744fb2cbf2de.mp4?t=1774165707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Rich Content &amp; Challenges</strong><br><strong>Dynamic Quest Network</strong>: Hunt werewolves, chase thieves, explore the Dream Eater\u2019s Labyrinth\u2026 Quests refresh randomly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auto AFK materials: Time House settings, automatic farming of various resources.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928980/extras/2b5ae0e45ff29e6bd6c221d8e82b58d4.poster.avif?t=1774165707\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928980/extras/2b5ae0e45ff29e6bd6c221d8e82b58d4.webm?t=1774165707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928980/extras/2b5ae0e45ff29e6bd6c221d8e82b58d4.mp4?t=1774165707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Key Features</strong><br><strong>Talent &amp; Gear DIY</strong>: Freely combine affixes + talents to discover hidden builds.<br><strong>Deep Character Progression</strong>: Starting Q&amp;A determines base stats; weapon mastery unlocks ultimate skills.<br><strong>Dynamic Economy</strong>: Gold buys supplies, Prestige unlocks S-quests, EXP levels heroes\u2014<i>resources interlock!</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3928980?t=1774165707","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3928980?t=1774165707","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928980/949612facb2a7642432ff7e6d3ede3f2ac0128e9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774165707","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928980/949612facb2a7642432ff7e6d3ede3f2ac0128e9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774165707","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>An Invitation to New Players</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201c1,000 gold coins, an empty tavern\u2014this is <i>your</i> start.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit your first member, take on E-rank quests, and forge your legend amidst clashing swords and magic\u2026</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One day, your guild will stand atop the sacred peaks of Elphar!\u201d</strong></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u300aWonderland\u300b\u2014 Forge Your Own Fantasy Tactics Legend!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a world of swords and sorcery, and build your unique adventurer\u2019s guild!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Strategy-First Tactical Gameplay</strong> <br><strong>Wisdom decides life or death; terrain turns the tide!</strong> <br>\u25b8 Assemble 4-hero squads tailored to missions with class and terrain tactics. <br>\u25b8 <strong>Dynamic Success Rate</strong>: Squad level/gear/stats affect outcomes. High-risk S-rank missions\u2014<i>timed and unique</i>! <br>\u25b8 <strong>Guild Co-op</strong>: Deploy members to solve puzzles, charge foes, or heal allies in brain-teasing yet thrilling turn-based battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928980/extras/227b4100dd3fda3e29ec7ff63d6b3cf5.poster.avif?t=1774165707\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928980/extras/227b4100dd3fda3e29ec7ff63d6b3cf5.webm?t=1774165707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st