 epic materials!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928980/extras/d45b5260b7c27aaf2509744fb2cbf2de.poster.avif?t=1774165707\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928980/extras/d45b5260b7c27aaf2509744fb2cbf2de.webm?t=1774165707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928980/extras/d45b5260b7c27aaf2509744fb2cbf2de.mp4?t=1774165707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Rich Content &amp; Challenges</strong><br><strong>Dynamic Quest Network</strong>: Hunt werewolves, chase thieves, explore the Dream Eater\u2019s Labyrinth\u2026 Quests refresh randomly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auto AFK materials: Time House settings, automatic farming of various resources.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928980/extras/2b5ae0e45ff29e6bd6c221d8e82b58d4.poster.avif?t=1774165707\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928980/extras/2b5ae0e45ff29e6bd6c221d8e82b58d4.webm?t=1774165707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928980/extras/2b5ae0e45ff29e6bd6c221d8e82b58d4.mp4?t=1774165707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Key Features</strong><br><strong>Talent &amp; Gear DIY</strong>: Freely combine affixes + talents to discover hidden builds.<br><strong>Deep Character Progression</strong>: Starting Q&amp;A determines base stats; weapon mastery unlocks ultimate s